{"id":"695163624479dc1e","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_NDerRow.md","title":"NDerRow","display":"NDerRow","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"NDerRow","parameters":["r","g","z1629","z1630","z1631"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"NDerRow"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>r</span><span>g</span><span>z1629</span><span>z1630</span><span>z1631</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：命名项与开放等式。有序参数：<code>r</code>、<code>g</code>、<code>z1629</code>、<code>z1630</code>、<code>z1631</code>。</p>\n<p>开放等式假设、α/指定根公理、对称、传递、一孔同余。：单行局部条件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ NDerRow r g z1629 z1630 z1631)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists t\n  (exists u\n    (and\n      (@ Pair t u z1631)\n      (and\n        (@ NMode r)\n        (and\n          (@ NEqs g)\n          (and\n            (@ NRaw t)\n            (and\n              (@ NRaw u)\n              (or\n                (exists z1638 (and (@ Pair t u z1638) (in z1638 g)))\n                (or\n                  (@ NAx r t u)\n                  (or\n                    (exists z1639 (exists z1640 (and (in z1639 z1630) (and (@ App z1629 z1639 z1640) (@ Pair u t z1640)))))\n                    (or\n                      (exists z1634\n                        (and\n                          (exists z1641\n                            (exists z1642 (and (in z1641 z1630) (and (@ App z1629 z1641 z1642) (@ Pair t z1634 z1642)))))\n                          (exists z1643\n                            (exists z1644 (and (in z1643 z1630) (and (@ App z1629 z1643 z1644) (@ Pair z1634 u z1644)))))))\n                      (exists z1635\n                        (exists z1636\n                          (exists z1637\n                            (and\n                            (exists z1645\n                            (exists z1646 (and (in z1645 z1630) (and (@ App z1629 z1645 z1646) (@ Pair z1636 z1637 z1646)))))\n                            (and (@ NPlug z1635 z1636 t) (@ NPlug z1635 z1637 u)))))))))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"db9c3028662cd4b5\" href=\"?note=db9c3028662cd4b5\" title=\"ZFC_NAx\">NAx</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"627569382a44bdf5\" href=\"?note=627569382a44bdf5\" title=\"ZFC_NEqs\">NEqs</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2e430f284172300e\" href=\"?note=2e430f284172300e\" title=\"ZFC_NMode\">NMode</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5beb47cd93dd9865\" href=\"?note=5beb47cd93dd9865\" title=\"ZFC_NPlug\">NPlug</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5ba5bcae5363217b\" href=\"?note=5ba5bcae5363217b\" title=\"ZFC_NRaw\">NRaw</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"0a7fe33bb2e95221\" href=\"?note=0a7fe33bb2e95221\" title=\"ZFC_Pair\">Pair</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ NDe